==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From ''[[tuttugu]]'' meaning "[[twenty]]" + ''[[og]]'' "[[and]]" + ''[[sex]]'' "[[six]]". Meaning '''twenty and six'''.

===Cardinal numeral===
{{head|is|numeral}}

# '''[[twenty-six]]'''; the cardinal number after [[tuttugu og fimm#Icelandic|tuttugu og fimm]] and before [[tuttugu og sjö#Icelandic|tuttugu og sjö]].

